{title: Kum Ba Yah, My Lord}
{artist: African American spiritual}
{key: C}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 66}

Verse 1
[C]Kum ba yah, my [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah;
kum ba yah, my [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah;
kum ba [Em]yah, my [Am]Lord, kum ba [F]yah,
O [C]Lord, kum [G7]ba [C]yah.

Verse 2
[C]Someone's crying, [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah;
someone's crying, [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah;
someone's [Em]crying, [Am]Lord, kum ba [F]yah,
O [C]Lord, kum [G7]ba [C]yah.

Verse 3
[C]Someone's praying, [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah;
someone's praying, [F]Lord, kum ba [C]yah;
someone's [Em]praying, [Am]Lord, kum ba [F]yah,
O [C]Lord, kum [G7]ba [C]yah.
